rno diseño escandinavo. La vivienda es muy luminosa y cuenta con chimenea, grandes ventanales y preciosas vistas al mar y a La Concha tanto desde el interior como desde sus terrazas.\n\nLa propiedad incluye garaje privado, una amplia piscina y generosas zonas exteriores, ideales para la vida familiar o para disfrutar con invitados. Perfecta como casa de vacaciones, también ofrece un excelente potencial de alquiler como inversión.\nUbicada en una comunidad cerrada y segura, la villa ofrece privacidad y tranquilidad, a la vez que ‌se ‌encuentra ‌cerca ‌de ‌prestigiosos ‌colegios internacionales, ‌campos de ‌golf, restaurantes y todos los ‌servicios ‌que ‌hacen ‌de ‌Nueva Andalucía una de ‌las ‌zonas ‌residenciales ‌más ‌demandadas ‌de ‌Marbella.","en":"Stylish 5-bedroom, 4.5-bathroom villa in Los Naranjos Hill Club, Nueva Andalucía, renovated with a sleek Scandinavian design. The home is filled with natural light and features a fireplace, large windows, and beautiful sea and La Concha views from the villa itself as well as its terraces.\nThe property includes a private garage, a large swimming pool, and generous outdoor space—ideal for family living or entertaining. Perfect as a holiday home, it also offers excellent rental potential as an investment.\nSet within a secure gated community, the villa enjoys privacy ‌and ‌tranquillity ‌while ‌being ‌close ‌to top ‌international schools, ‌renowned golf courses, restaurants, and ‌all ‌the ‌lifestyle ‌amenities ‌that make Nueva Andalucía ‌one ‌of ‌Marbella’s ‌most ‌sought-after ‌residential ‌areas."},"features":{"es":["Cerca de Golf","Cerca de Tiendas","Cerca de Ciudad","Cerca de Colegios","Aire Acondicionado","Mar","Montaña","Panorámicas","Alarma"],"en":["Close To Golf","Close To Shops","Close To Town","Close To Schools","Air Conditioning","Sea","Mountain","Panoramic","Alarm System"]},"piscina":false,"parking":false,"jardin":false,"estado":"Available"}